<title>JAPAN: Takarabune - 95/96 group results. [CORRECTED 10:00 GMT]</title>
<headline>Takarabune - 95/96 group results. [CORRECTED 10:00 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects year to 95/96 from 96/97)</p>
<p>Year to August 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 23.19		vs	   23.34</p>
<p> Operating	  142    mln	  vs	  515    mln</p>
<p> Current     loss 177    mln	  vs	 prft 83 mln</p>
<p> Net	   loss 227    mln	  vs	 prft 21 mln</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 30.10 yen	  vs     prft 2.89 yen</p>
<p> Diluted EPS  loss 30.10 yen	  vs     prft 2.89 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Takarabune Co Ltd is a leading furniture retailer.</p>
</text>
